<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH KAUCUK MAIN UNIT POSTS CZK 58 MLN Q1 GROSS.</title>
<headline>CZECH KAUCUK MAIN UNIT POSTS CZK 58 MLN Q1 GROSS.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The main production subsidiary of Czech petrochemical concern Kaucuk Group a.s., Kaucuk a.s., said its first quarter gross profit totalled 58 million crowns.</p>
<p>The company did not release comparative results for 1996 for Kaucuk a.s., which comprises most of the group's turnover, but consolidated group profit for the first quarter last year was 251 million crowns.</p>
</text>
